Hobbits and I like that.\rMy name is Tom Bombadil!\r\rI'm as old as Arda itself and was one of the first beings in Middleearth.\rMy voice is my power and my singing is magical.\rIt makes me stronger, heals people and makes my enemies flee.\r\rI'm here in Willowbottom to warn the Hobbits here of the dark mystery that is rising in the north.\rLooks like you are an adventurer and I could use your help to stop the evil.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
