 the lands of Eriador and are getting more every day.\r\rFly with me on an Eagle to the place and let's check why they are there.\r\rWhen you are ready, cross the bridge and hop on the Eagle, we will meet there!\r\rThank you @p !\r","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
