 the wonders crafted by the Elves and were coveted by many.\r\rI thought all would be lost. That explained why the Orcs raided the area, they were searching for it.\r\rYou have to keep it safe! \r\rI need to think about what to do next, come back to me again later, when I have more answers.\r\rUntil then! \rFarewell @p!\r\r(starts singing again)\r\r>>(will be continued)<<","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
