the treasure.\r\rOthers are saying that is nonesense and its just a pile of snow. \r\rBut why didnt the expeditions returned? \rMany brave dwarven soldiers tried to enter the ruins... no one returned. Today I want to take a look at this myself.\r\rI will follow you. If there is really a drake we are stronger together!","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
