 not the Orcs raiding here, it's the origin of the evil in the old Fornost fortress.\rThere are many Orcs from Angmar, it seems like they are looking for something there.\rIf you could go there and find out what's that all about. \r\rI bet if you could kill enough of the Orc captains there, than they might retreat back to where they came from.\rWithout leadership they are weaker!\r","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
