r. Because of you, the festival will probably be able to take place after all.\n\nBut I'm still worried about the white wolves, there haven't been any sightings in this area for years. \nI should tell Saradoc the mayor in Buckland. If anyone knows how to fend off a wolf attack, it's him.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
