me is Lobelia Sackville-Baggins. I'm living here with my husband Otho, the cousin of Bilbo... speaking of Bilbo. He's celebrating his 111th birthday today. You must be one of the party guests. And now shoo shoo out with you, leave me alone.","text_height":400,"text_offset_x":0,"text_offset_y":0,"text_pitch":1,"text_sound":"minecraft:random.wood_click","text_width":300,"time_availability":0,"title_color":16777215,"title_pos":0,"visual_preset":0}
